{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"6c243c4ce42e05506cc5bbad89fbf963fe22dc8fd7b0957ba838da7bd0b88656","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"3bd78dce707cebe738f5e1e8c42a0bc5eda58b49ecf739320dbb1b4d8bc4969f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3c496fb546a23ba6ab3859ca273a3cbd6d4aca353915a340e483d5d8467e68b4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source says \"fire a bolt of plaguefire\", and world-artifacts.lua:180 confirms it is a projectile: tg={type=\"bolt\", range=5}. The target \"召唤出一团疫火\" (\"summon a mass of plaguefire\") changes firing a bolt into summoning, which misdescribes how the item works. It should say it fires a bolt of plaguefire."},{"revision_key":"3d80f4a586f3325c118ecbc8852f333f0f14ab4a95e132d36f5b6ff29c528e41","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The condition \"Have your party composed of at least 5 demons\" (achievements/all.lua:59, a can_gain that counts party members) means at least 5 demons in your party. The target \"同时召唤至少5个恶魔\" (\"summon at least 5 demons at once\") narrows it to summoning. That is not how the source states the condition."},{"revision_key":"3ddfbf1e999ec832384e54e71e6d6dcc9087bb9f74ac5116139dc9c58e804df5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4130b8095917def9977329ebfb98ad418775ad0a163d74ee11b26a5c22005369","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"searing-halls/npcs.lua:126 has two meaning errors. \"towers above you\" means the demon looms tall over you, but the target \"朝你走来\" (\"walks toward you\") turns it into an action. \"all the portals in the nearby Fearscape area\" loses its location: the target keeps only \"附近所有的传送门\" (\"all the nearby portals\") and drops the Fearscape (恶魔空间) place name."},{"revision_key":"43134b3daeeadebcfd1217a934c0c39557788de65ac2b81370f384c7e4a91b1d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"In lore/demon.lua:404, \"Sher'Tul portals ... will occasionally emit a shade\" says the portals only occasionally release a spirit. The target renders it as \"夏·图尔传送门附近经常徘徊着...灵魂\" (\"spirits often linger near the Sher'Tul portals\"). That changes occasionally to often and changes emitted from the portals to lingering near them. It also says \"埃亚尔探险队\" (\"the Eyal expedition\") where the source only says \"our scouting parties\"."},{"revision_key":"435ca9b7490f81665c6737895a47d51412850a38267b937e5f24a942e94049ff","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source (heart-of-fire.lua:144) says the curse spreads \"to other burning enemies in radius 1\" with \"%d fire damage on spreading\". The target changes this into a different mechanism: a 50% chance, spreading to enemies that are not yet cursed \"whether or not they were already burning\", and total damage split into half immediately and half over 3 turns. None of this appears in the source text or the frozen snippet. The envelope gives no local checkout location for the cursed-flame effect or spread implementation (the source is also unpinned), so I cannot verify it. Source evidence from the implementation is needed to confirm or reject this version."},{"revision_key":"46fd21dfbecae5f9a1971d86939ade7ff66f85f85f001ebc4443ead6e5bcef90","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4b928dc676ce78e4772e0a841731f9738daec86d1df89994fac64326c3b91249","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4dd916e4cbcf28e4aec901cfe7240fb6ff481645fcf9643533396ba87a771432","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"Newline invariant broken. The source ends with a trailing \\n after the last paragraph \"(...touch the panel.)\" (31 LF in total, with empty-line indices 1..31 including the final position 31). The target ends at \"）\" with no newline (30 LF). All other empty-line positions and the 187 color/italic marker pairs match."}]}